title: "road-risk-ranking-spain: ranking of road crash risk in Spain with uncertainty"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Méndez"
    given-names: "Manuel"
    affiliation: "Design and Testing of Reliable Systems Research Group, Complutense University of Madrid"
